  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Loam 3.23.0: Loam.Charts adds RadarChart (spider chart) — one axis per category arranged radially, each series a polygon at value/max, with Max/Levels/Filled. It introduces a shared MultiSeriesChartBase (extracted from CartesianChartBase) so radar reuses the same multi-series collection, legend, theme palette, hover/click, and empty state as bar/line. Single-series via Values, multi-series via Series; labels from Labels; needs at least three axes. Additive. See https://araxis.github.io/loam/guide/changelog",
